  "term": "sensorimotor",
  "definition": "Sensorimotor refers to the linked functioning of sensory and motor systems, especially how sensory areas and motor areas work together during movement. In the packet, it describes the interaction between somatosensory cortex and motor cortex in movement execution and initiation.",
